			"Message": "chore(release): Update dependencies and refine npm configuration\n\nThis commit updates several key dependencies including @playform/build, @playform/compress, astro, vite, and zod to their latest versions. It also modifies the .npmrc file to use deep linking for workspace packages and removes the --provenance flag from the npm publish command in the GitHub workflow due to compatibility issues. Additionally, the homepage URL in package.json has been updated for better readability.",
